Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Graveyard = Plains; Firebending Lesson
? Bot1.Library.Count = 13
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
! Bot1.Attack(Sylvan Caryatid > Bot2)
Bot1.Attack(Platypus-Bear > Bot2)
